# ModifAI Input Validation — V2 Build Plan

> **Core pillars:** User Experience · Accuracy · Efficiency  
> **Target users:** Small businesses, startups, researchers, developers  
> **Scope:** All 10 identified problems + intent refinement + chunk quality validation

---

## How to read this plan

Each phase is a deployable increment — Phase 1 must ship before Phase 2 starts.
Within each phase, modules are ordered by dependency.
Every change lists: *what changes*, *where*, and *exactly why*.

