## Execution Order Summary

| Phase | What ships | Estimated effort |
|---|---|---|
| **Phase 1** | PDF guard, language detection, transparency banner | Small — mostly new isolated modules |
| **Phase 2** | Vague intent detection, intent expansion, document type detection | Medium — new LLM call, UI changes |
| **Phase 3** | Chunk filter, relevance sampling, chunk quality gating | Medium — core algorithm changes |
| **Phase 4** | Actionable feedback, page progress, session cache, mobile | Medium — mostly UI and plumbing |

> Phase 1 and Phase 4.4 (mobile) can be worked on in parallel if you have two people.  
> Phase 3 depends on `document_keywords` from Phase 2.2 — do not skip Phase 2.

