## What does NOT change

- The core cost architecture (free local checks first, LLM only when genuinely uncertain) — this stays
- The sqrt-scaled sample count formula — this stays (the *selection strategy* changes, not the count)
- The 0.4/0.7 similarity band — this stays as the default (document type detection in Phase 2.3 adjusts it per type)
- The proceed/confirm/block decision framework — this stays (only the presentation of results changes)

